---
import Notepad from "@/components/Notepad.astro";
import { org, repos } from "@/lib/tribe";

const lab = repos.find((r) => r.name === "entropylab") ?? repos[0];
const shareText = encodeURIComponent("ooga booga. I visited the tribe and now I want a clanker. we eat bananas. we make code. we give code to tribe.");
const guestbook = `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${shareText}&url=${encodeURIComponent(org.url)}`;
---

<section class="section" id="join">
  <div class="container join">
    <div class="section__head">
      <span class="section__kicker">membership</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">join the tribe</h2>
    </div>

    <Notepad title="join_tribe.txt - Notepad">HOW TO JOIN TEAM OOGA BOOGA
===========================

1. listen to a space
2. grab the mic. say your idea out loud.
3. grunt at your clanker. push to a rock.
4. get merged to rock.

entry fee ........ your idea + a clanker
<del class="theme-replaced">application ...... none</del>
<mark class="theme-update">door ............. open</mark>
<del class="theme-replaced">interview ........ none</del>
<mark class="theme-update">résumé ........... optional</mark>
<del class="theme-replaced">degree ........... none</del>
<mark class="theme-update">work ............. public</mark>
<del class="theme-replaced">gatekeeping ...... none</del>
<mark class="theme-update">review ........... required</mark>

we are not the smartest group in bitcoin.
<del class="theme-replaced">we are the loudest one that ships.</del>
<mark class="theme-update">we help each other turn ideas into working code.</mark>

ooga booga.<Fragment slot="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--default btn--banana" href="https://x.com/w_s_bitcoin" rel="noopener">listen to a Space</a>
        <a class="btn" href={`${lab.url}/fork`} rel="noopener">fork {lab.name}</a>
        <a class="btn" href={guestbook} rel="noopener" data-status-text="Opens X with a pre-written grunt">sign our guestbook</a>
      </Fragment></Notepad>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .join {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
</style>
